    "title": "Basic Pro Racing Series",
    "summary": "When the premium Pro Racing series debuted in 1997, this basic series was also issued to supplement it. Cars in this series featured a few cost saving measures compared to more expensive alternative, such as plastic wheels and bases, and a few less details. While the Premium castings where made for display purposes, the Basic line was meant for the track.",
    "date": "2026-10-15",
    "source": "Hot Wheels Wiki",
